1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,283
How does the kidney make urine four times more concentrated than blood?

2
00:00:04,283 --> 00:00:05,585
The loop of Henle.

3
00:00:05,585 --> 00:00:10,677
The ascending limb pumps salt out into the medulla, but it is waterproof.

4
00:00:10,677 --> 00:00:17,213
The descending limb, running the other way right beside it, lets water out into that salty fluid.

